          'Review the permissions each task needs. Where a provider supports team roles, prefer suitable limited access over sharing primary credentials. Ask who on the agency team can see files, what outside tools they use and how access is removed when staff change. An agency’s assertion that a shortcut is common does not establish that a provider permits it. Check the provider’s current rules through its official channels.'
